flowchart TD
Test["Test scenario<br/>Owns configuration and cleanup<br/>Correlates requests by mapping"]
HttpEmulator["HttpEmulator<br/>Random-port WireMock server<br/>Stub / Sequence / request journal<br/>Dispose owned mappings/server"]
RequestCapture["RequestCapture<br/>In-memory HttpMessageHandler<br/>Invoke one generated operation<br/>Capture method/path/query/body"]
Admin["AdminEmulatorClient<br/>Settings / benchmarks HTTP API<br/>Owned helpers register deletion<br/>Separate control-service contract"]
App["Application under test<br/>Explicit upstream URL configuration"]
AdminServer["Admin emulator service<br/>SampleApp implements neutral demo"]
Test --> HttpEmulator
Test --> RequestCapture
Test --> Admin
App -->|upstream calls| HttpEmulator
Admin -->|HTTP| AdminServer
